<rml>
<head>
	<title>Startup Intro</title>
	<style>
		body {
			margin: 0px;
			width: 100%;
			height: 100%;
			font-family: OCRAStd;
			color: #FFFFFF;
			background-color: #000000;
		}
		#overlay {
			position: absolute;
			left: 0px;
			top: 0px;
			width: 1920px;
			height: 1080px;
			background-color: #000000;
		}
		#logo_panel {
			position: absolute;
			left: 0px;
			top: 0px;
			width: 1920px;
			height: 1080px;
		}
		#studio_logo {
			position: absolute;
			left: 640px;
			top: 220px;
			width: 640px;
			height: 640px;
			opacity: 0;
		}
		#warning_panel {
			position: absolute;
			left: 0px;
			top: 0px;
			width: 1920px;
			height: 1080px;
			display: none;
		}
		.warning-line {
			position: absolute;
			left: 0px;
			width: 1920px;
			font-size: 26px;
			text-align: center;
			color: #FFFFFF;
		}
		#warning_title {
			position: absolute;
			left: 0px;
			top: 300px;
			width: 1920px;
			font-size: 56px;
			text-align: center;
			color: rgb(71, 255, 105);
		}
	</style>
</head>
<body data-rml-ui-document="1" data-ui-layout="scaled" data-canvas-width="1920" data-canvas-height="1080" data-preview-scale="1">
	<div id="overlay">
		<div id="logo_panel">
			<img id="studio_logo" src="../Data/code-monkey-studio/code-monkey-studio.png" width="640" height="640" />
		</div>
		<div id="warning_panel">
			<div id="warning_title">Warning</div>
			<div id="warning_line_1" class="warning-line" style="top: 420px;">A very small percentage of individuals may experience epileptic seizures</div>
			<div id="warning_line_2" class="warning-line" style="top: 460px;">or blackouts when exposed to certain light patterns or flashing lights.</div>
			<div id="warning_line_3" class="warning-line" style="top: 540px;">If you or anyone in your family has an epileptic condition,</div>
			<div id="warning_line_4" class="warning-line" style="top: 580px;">consult a physician before playing or viewing.</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</body>
</rml>
